      "readme": "# PM-33: BS EN ISO 19650 Asset Information Model (AIM) Handover\n\n- **Phase**: `Phase 6: Handover, OR&T & Closeout (RIBA 6-7)`\n- **RIBA Stage**: `RIBA Stage 6-7`\n- **P6 Milestone Gate**: `M7060 + 30d`\n- **WBS Scope**: `WBS 6.5 & 7.0`\n- **Governing Standards**: BS EN ISO 19650-3 Operational AIM, BS 1192-4 COBie v2.4\n- **Focus Areas**: As-Built Federated BIM, COBie Asset CSV/XLSX, CMMS Barcodes & PPM, Red-Line As-Builts, Warranties & O&M Vault\n\n## Module Overview\nDeliver verified COBie asset registers, as-built BIM models, O&M manuals, warranties, and CMMS integration packages.\n\n## Ordered Flashcard Documents (`Doc 1` -> `Doc 4`)\n\n| Doc | Category | Title | Exact Local File | Companion / Notes |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Doc 1 | Standard | BS EN ISO 19650-3 Operational Asset Information Mgmt & BS 1192-4 COBie | `PM33_Doc1_Standard_BS_EN_ISO_19650_3_Operational_Asset_Rev.004.docx` | ISO 19650-3 / BS 1192-4 |\n| Doc 2 | Deliverable | Verified Asset Information Model (AIM) & As-Built Federated BIM Archive | `PM33_Doc2_Deliverable_Verified_Asset_Information_Model_Rev.004.docx` | As-Built Digital Twin |\n| Doc 3 | Template | Structured COBie / CMMS Equipment Asset Register (Barcodes, Serials, PPM) | `PM33_Doc3_Template_Structured_COBie_CMMS_Equipment_Rev.004.xlsx` | CMMS Bulk Import Pack |\n| Doc 4 | Audit | Final Red-Line As-Built Drawings, O&M Manuals, Warranties & Test Vault | `PM33_Doc4_Audit_Final_Red_Line_As_Built_Drawings_O_Rev.004.xlsx` | CDE Published Archive |\n\n## Study Takeaway (`Why Each Document Matters`)\n- **Doc 1 (Standard)**: Bridge construction CDE models seamlessly into live CMMS maintenance software.\n- **Doc 2 (Deliverable)**: Deliver geo-tagged 3D models matching every installed pipe, valve, and breaker.\n- **Doc 3 (Template)**: Pre-load thousands of maintainable assets with OEM warranty dates and PPM intervals.\n- **Doc 4 (Audit)**: Audit 100% receipt of signed statutory O&M volumes before final retention payment.\n",
