      "readme": "# PM-34: Commercial Final Account, Variations Settlement & DLP\n\n- **Phase**: `Phase 6: Handover, OR&T & Closeout (RIBA 6-7)`\n- **RIBA Stage**: `RIBA Stage 6-7`\n- **P6 Milestone Gate**: `COD + 12/24m DLP`\n- **WBS Scope**: `WBS 7.0-COD`\n- **Governing Standards**: NEC4 Cl. 5 / FIDIC Cl. 14 Final Account & Retention Rules\n- **Focus Areas**: Final Account Deed, Closed Variations (VOs), DLP Defect SLA Log, 50% Retention @ PC, Final 5% @ DLP Expiry\n\n## Module Overview\nReconcile all CEs/variations, close prime cost sums, manage retention release mechanics, and track 12/24-month Defect Liability Period.\n\n## Ordered Flashcard Documents (`Doc 1` -> `Doc 4`)\n\n| Doc | Category | Title | Exact Local File | Companion / Notes |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Doc 1 | Standard | NEC4 / FIDIC Commercial Final Account Agreement & Defects Liability Rules | `PM34_Doc1_Standard_NEC4_FIDIC_Commercial_Final_Account_Rev.004.docx` | NEC4 Cl. 5 / FIDIC Cl. 14 |\n| Doc 2 | Deliverable | Agreed Commercial Final Account Statement & Closed Variation Schedule | `PM34_Doc2_Deliverable_Agreed_Commercial_Final_Account_Rev.004.docx` | Final Account Deed |\n| Doc 3 | Template | 12-to-24 Month Defects Liability Period (DLP) & Warranty Callout Tracker | `PM34_Doc3_Template_12_to_24_Month_Defects_Liability_Rev.004.xlsx` | Post-PC Defect SLA |\n| Doc 4 | Audit | Practical Completion 50% Retention Release & Making-Good Defects Cert | `PM34_Doc4_Audit_Practical_Completion_50_Retention_Rev.004.xlsx` | Final Certificate Gate |\n\n## Study Takeaway (`Why Each Document Matters`)\n- **Doc 1 (Standard)**: Execute legally binding full-and-final commercial settlement eliminating latent claims.\n- **Doc 2 (Deliverable)**: Reconcile provisional sums, CEs, contra-charges, and final capex EUR/MW actuals.\n- **Doc 3 (Template)**: Track response SLAs for post-handover snags and latent leaks during warranty year 1.\n- **Doc 4 (Audit)**: Release second half of performance bond/retention only after DLP clearance sign-off.\n",
