      "keyFacts": [
        "Governance: PMI Close Project Phase + Sponsor Final Benefits Realization",
        "Financial Benchmark: Actual EUR/MW Capex vs. Sanctioned FID Baseline",
        "Knowledge Asset: Actionable Lessons Learned (FID, Grid, OFCI, Cx, BCAR) archived",
        "Legal Closure: Tax clearance (RCT), collateral warranties & statutory bond releases",
        "Program Exit: Formal archive of P6 As-Built XER & SteerCo Closure Resolution"
      ],
      "readme": "# PM-36: Lessons Learned Archive, Benefits Realization & Closeout\n\n- **Phase**: `Phase 6: Handover, OR&T & Closeout (RIBA 6-7)`\n- **RIBA Stage**: `RIBA Stage 7`\n- **P6 Milestone Gate**: `Program Closeout`\n- **WBS Scope**: `All WBS`\n- **Governing Standards**: PMI Close Project Phase, Enterprise PMO Benefits Realization\n- **Focus Areas**: Actual EUR/MW Benchmark, Schedule Lesson Logs, Contract Discharge Letters, Bond Returns, Sponsor Final Sign-Off\n\n## Module Overview\nPublish benchmark EUR/MW actuals, schedule variance post-mortems, contract closeout certificates, and enterprise knowledge transfer.\n\n## Ordered Flashcard Documents (`Doc 1` -> `Doc 4`)\n\n| Doc | Category | Title | Exact Local File | Companion / Notes |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Doc 1 | Standard | PMI Close Project Phase Standard & Enterprise PMO Benchmarking Guidelines | `PM36_Doc1_Standard_PMI_Close_Project_Phase_Standard_Rev.004.docx` | PMI Closeout / PMO Std |\n| Doc 2 | Deliverable | Final Project Closeout Report & Actual EUR/MW Capex + Schedule Benchmark | `PM36_Doc2_Deliverable_Final_Project_Closeout_Report_Rev.004.docx` | Board Benefits Review |\n| Doc 3 | Template | Cross-Discipline End-to-End Lessons Learned Register (CSA, Grid, Cx, OR&T) | `PM36_Doc3_Template_Cross_Discipline_End_to_End_Lessons_Rev.004.xlsx` | PMO Knowledge Base |\n| Doc 4 | Audit | Formal Contract Closeout Notices, Bond Returns & Benefits Realization Sign-Off | `PM36_Doc4_Audit_Formal_Contract_Closeout_Notices_Rev.004.xlsx` | Sponsor Final Discharge |\n\n## Study Takeaway (`Why Each Document Matters`)\n- **Doc 1 (Standard)**: Institutionalize actual build costs and schedule durations to inform DC45 Phase 2.\n- **Doc 2 (Deliverable)**: Compare FID forecasts vs. final outturn IRR, EUR/MW capex, and critical-path variances.\n- **Doc 3 (Template)**: Capture procurement pitfalls, OFCI lessons, and Irish permitting timelines for future sites.\n- **Doc 4 (Audit)**: Confirm parent guarantees returned, CDE archived, and project team formally released.\n",
